This product bundles or draws on the following:

  Noto Sans Bengali
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    https://github.com/notofonts/bengali
    Bundled at assets/fonts/ so that Bangla conjuncts render identically on
    every handset, including those whose system Bangla font is incomplete.

  PWD Schedule of Rates 2022 (2nd revised), 16th edition
    Published by the Public Works Department, Government of Bangladesh.
    Rates in assets/content/rates/pwd_sor_2022.json were extracted from the
    published PDF on 2026-09-02. The edition and its effective date are shown
    in the app wherever a rate appears.

  PWD Schedule of Rates for Electro-Mechanical Works 2022
    Published by the Public Works Department, Government of Bangladesh.
    Rates in assets/content/rates/pwd_sor_em_2022.json were extracted from the
    published PDF on 2026-09-02. It is kept as its own table rather than merged
    with the civil volume, which states a different markup basis. Where the
    published PDF misprints a rate, the cell is recorded as unavailable rather
    than repaired by inference.

  Dhaka Mohanagar Imarat (Nirman, Unnayan, Sangrakkhan o Aparasaran) Bidhimala,
  2025 — S.R.O. No. 469-Ain/2025
    Bangladesh Gazette, Extraordinary, 14 December 2025. Table 5, the
    road-width FAR index, is reproduced in assets/content/rules/far_2025.json
    and extracted by tool/extract_far_gazette.py. It is the gazette's own text,
    cited and not relicensed, and the app reports it as a ceiling rather than
    as a permission.

  বাড়ি নির্মাণ ও সাইট সুপারভিশন (2019)
    Consulted as a source of facts only. No text, table or plate from it is
    reproduced. Every figure taken from it was checked against BNBC 2020, the
    PWD schedule or a BDS standard before use and recorded in docs/FACTS_V2.md
    with its verdict; figures that could not be corroborated are marked in the
    app, and its 2019 rates and wages were discarded rather than shown. Every
    diagram in this app is drawn in code from a verified dimension, not scanned.

  Directorate General of Food — 1000 MT godown type design
    Working drawings consulted to build worked examples and measurable
    checklist items. Dimensions from that set are presented as that type
    design's figures, never as national standards. The consultants named on the
    sheets are instruments of service and are not endorsers of this app.

  Bangladesh National Building Code (BNBC) 2020
    Cited as the source for technical content. Clause-level citations are
    marked "review" until checked by a licensed civil engineer; see
    docs/CONTENT_REVIEW.md.

  Flutter and the Dart SDK
    BSD-3-Clause. https://flutter.dev

  Third-party Dart packages
    Their licences are listed in the app under Settings, and in full via
    `flutter pub deps`.

